    "input": "Senior Full Stack Engineer - Verdance Energy Systems\nhttps://jobs.example.test/job-offer/verdance-senior-full-stack-engineer-remote-typescript\nPublished: 31.07.2026 | Remote | B2B | 32,00 - 36,00 EUR net/hour\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION\n\nWe are looking for a Senior Full Stack Engineer (React + TypeScript) to join a small, senior team building next-generation tools for the renewable energy transition. You will own features end to end, from concept to production, on a platform used by solar and energy companies. This role suits a strong full stack developer who writes clean, well-tested code, cares about scalability and maintainability, and is comfortable shaping both technical solutions and product direction alongside engineering peers and product managers.\n\nAbout the Project:\nVerdance Energy Systems is a technology company accelerating the shift to renewable energy through data and AI. Its platform helps solar and energy companies monitor, analyze, and optimize renewable energy assets using drone data and AI driven insights, and has supported more than 10,000 projects across 80 countries. You will work on the next generation of this platform, combining cloud native infrastructure, full stack development, and modern engineering practices to deliver a scalable, data driven system that powers decision making for sustainable energy infrastructure.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nLead end to end development of new platform features, from planning and prioritization through implementation, testing, and deployment;\nContribute to architectural decisions, ensuring high performance, maintainability, and scalability;\nCollaborate closely with product managers and engineering peers to shape technical solutions and product direction;\nWrite clean, efficient, well tested code following established best practices;\nParticipate in product brainstorming, refinement, and continuous improvement sessions;\nShare knowledge and mentor peers within a small, agile team.\n\nQualifications:\n\nStrong fluency in JavaScript and TypeScript, with solid experience in React and Node.js;\nProven track record of building scalable, production grade applications;\nWorking knowledge of relational databases (PostgreSQL) and containerization (Docker);\nExperience with or strong interest in cloud infrastructure on Azure or AWS;\nPassion for clean, maintainable, reusable code with a strong focus on testing;\nCollaborative mindset, self driven approach to problem solving, and ability to pick up new technologies quickly;\nExperience with Python or Machine Learning is a plus.\n\nRecruitment Process:\n\nHR screening (30 minute Zoom call);\nTechnical challenge: coding round, problem solving round, brainstorming round;\nOffer call.\n\nVerdance Energy Systems is a fictional employer used as a test fixture.\n\nTECH STACK\nEnglish C1 | TypeScript Master | JavaScript Master | AWS Advanced | PostgreSQL Advanced | Node.js Advanced | AI Advanced | Docker Advanced | React Advanced\n",
